      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I am so sorry you are feeling this way; it sounds like an incredibly painful and isolating experience to feel disconnected from yourself. Please know that sharing these feelings is a brave first step, even if it doesn't make the pain go away immediately. If you have a therapist, doctor, or trusted friend, reaching out to them for support can help you navigate these emotions. You are not alone, and your current state may not be permanent.",
